</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2e1b57e8-943a-11f1-9102-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T025210Z-1254063032-RC2QUMA1KPYR-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ECONOMY-INFLATION.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2e1b57e8-943a-11f1-9102-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T025210Z-1254063032-RC2QUMA1KPYR-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ECONOMY-INFLATION.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">323c8644-943a-11f1-be26-bff4246dbc52</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 21:35:08 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2e1b57e8-943a-11f1-9102-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T025210Z-1254063032-RC2QUMA1KPYR-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-ECONOMY-INFLATION.jpg">REUTERS - China Daily CDIC</source><dc:creator>安娜</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>伊朗称美国接受“全部条件”才会重开霍尔木兹海峡 特朗普强调经济施压</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260809-%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E7%A7%B0%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%97-%E5%85%A8%E9%83%A8%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6-%E6%89%8D%E4%BC%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%BC%80%E9%9C%8D%E5%B0%94%E6%9C%A8%E5%85%B9%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%BC%BA%E8%B0%83%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E6%96%BD%E5%8E%8B</link><description>
伊朗伊斯兰革命卫队周日（8月9日）表示，除非美国接受德黑兰提出的“全部”条件，否则霍尔木兹海峡将继续关闭。美国总统特朗普则淡化伊朗的强硬要求，暗示将继续保持经济压力，似乎暂时放弃对伊朗发动新一轮军事打击。
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d3d77d70-9439-11f1-97a6-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T142452Z-1451680382-RC2YSMAMJZ33-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-SHIPPING-HORMUZ.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d3d77d70-9439-11f1-97a6-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T142452Z-1451680382-RC2YSMAMJZ33-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-SHIPPING-HORMUZ.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d7fbee04-9439-11f1-b434-59efb618dfeb</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 21:32:37 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d3d77d70-9439-11f1-97a6-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-06T142452Z-1451680382-RC2YSMAMJZ33-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS-SHIPPING-HORMUZ.jpg">REUTERS - Stringer</source><dc:creator>安娜</dc:creator></item><item><category>中国</category><title>台风“白海豚”两度登陆浙江 超过百万人疏散</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD/20260809-%E5%8F%B0%E9%A3%8E-%E7%99%BD%E6%B5%B7%E8%B1%9A-%E4%B8%A4%E5%BA%A6%E7%99%BB%E9%99%86%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F-%E8%B6%85%E8%BF%87%E7%99%BE%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BA%E7%96%8F%E6%95%A3</link><description>
